# Getting set up, one question at a time, the same in a private chat and a group: name → capital one
# → where and when. Each answer gets the next question right away (aimed at whoever owes it), a
# message never asks two things, the agent's own question waits when Atlas already asked one, and
# anyone who goes quiet on an open question gets one beckon a few hours later.
today 2026-10-10 14:00
members ayush? maya leo

# A private chat with someone Atlas only has a number for, who opens with a trip ask.
dm ayush
~agent text: a solo trip sounds fun! where are you thinking of heading?
ayush: can you help me plan a trip by myself
expect atlas ~ "plan a solo trip with you"
expect atlas ~ "reply with your first name"
expect atlas !~ "capital one"
expect atlas !~ "where are you thinking"

# The name, then the bank question on its own.
ayush: Ayush
expect atlas reacted like
expect atlas says 2
expect atlas ~ "want to connect your capital one so i can plan around real budgets?"
expect atlas !~ "where"

ayush: yes connect my cap 1
expect atlas ~ "here's yours ayush 🔒"
expect atlas !~ "where"

# Connected: straight on to where and when, nothing else in the same go.
ayush connects
expect atlas says 2
expect atlas ~ "you're connected ✓"
expect atlas ~ "next up so i can start planning: where are you thinking of heading, and when?"

# Nothing back: one beckon a few hours later, then no more.
clock +4h
expect atlas ~ "still up for a trip?"
expect atlas ~ "where are you thinking of heading, and when?"
clock +1d
expect atlas !~ "still up for a trip?"

# The group: the intro's one question is the bank, then where and when once someone is through, and
# whoever hasn't answered is beckoned by name.
group
atlas joins by maya
expect atlas ~ "want to connect your capital one"
expect atlas !~ "where are we thinking"
maya: nah
expect atlas ~ "maya, roughly how much do you want to spend on this trip"
maya: like 800
expect atlas ~ "got it maya, i'll plan around that"
expect atlas ~ "next up so i can start planning: where are we thinking, and when?"
clock +4h
expect atlas ~ "still need a rough budget from you"
expect atlas ~ "leo"
expect atlas !~ "maya,"
expect transcript !~ /demo|sandbox|nessie|synthetic|simulated/
